<section class="reviews">
    <h3 class="reviews-title">DMC Delorean Reviews</h3>
    <div class="reviews-container">
        <div class="review-card">
            <div class="review-profile">
                <img src="/images/reviews/marty-mcfly.png" alt="marty-mcfly" class="review-image">
                <div class="name-container">
                    <p class="name">Marty McFly</p>
                    <p class="profession">Time-Travel Consultant</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="review-text">Wait a minute, Doc. Are you telling me this thing goes 88mph? So fast it's almost like traveling in time!</p>
            <img src="/images/reviews/stars.png" alt="stars" class="stars">
        </div>
        <div class="review-card">
            <div class="review-profile">
                <img src="/images/reviews/brian.png" alt="brian" class="review-image">
                <div class="name-container">
                    <p class="name">Brian</p>
                    <p class="profession">Street Racer</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="review-text">I live my life a quarter-mile at a time, but I’ve never seen a 10-second car with gull-wing doors.</p>
            <img src="/images/reviews/stars.png" alt="stars" class="stars">
        </div>
        <div class="review-card">
            <div class="review-profile">
                <img src="/images/reviews/john-wick.png" alt="john-wick" class="review-image">
                <div class="name-container">
                    <p class="name">John Wick</p>
                    <p class="profession">Baba-Yaga</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="review-text">Yeah!</p>
            <img src="/images/reviews/stars.png" alt="stars" class="stars">
        </div>
        <div class="review-card">
            <div class="review-profile">
                <img src="/images/reviews/uhura.png" alt="uhura" class="review-image">
                <div class="name-container">
                    <p class="name">Lieutenant Uhura</p>
                    <p class="profession">Communications Officer</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="review-text">Fascinating. It’s like a primitive shuttlecraft, but with much better styling.</p>
            <img src="/images/reviews/stars.png" alt="stars" class="stars">
        </div>
        <div class="review-card">
            <div class="review-profile">
                <img src="/images/reviews/peter-quill.png" alt="peter-quill" class="review-image">
                <div class="name-container">
                    <p class="name">Peter Quill</p>
                    <p class="profession">Intergalactic Ravager</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="review-text">Finally! A ride that looks as good as my Awesome Mix Vol. 1 sounds.</p>
            <img src="/images/reviews/stars.png" alt="stars" class="stars">
        </div>
    </div>
</section>